blocks.en:
Capability Taxonomy and Distribution. FastBench categorizes its 306 QA pairs into six capability dimensions (Fig. 2 2(b) ):
(1) Action & Physical Interaction (51.96%) covers fine-grained action recognition, physical contact detection, and rapid event counting;
(2) Predictive & Causal Reasoning (14.38%) evaluates action anticipation and causal inference;
(3) Motion & Spatiotemporal Tracking (13.40%) tests spatial reasoning and trajectory tracking under rapid motion;
(4) Entity & Visual Perception (9.48%) assesses object and text recognition under motion blur;
(5) Temporal & State Dynamics (8.17%) covers temporal sequencing and sudden state changes; and
(6) Streaming & Online Detection (2.61%) targets real-time localization of action boundaries.
Together, these dimensions assess fine-grained perception and higher-level reasoning under streaming constraints.

blocks.zh:
能力分类与分布. Fast Bench将其306个QA对分为6个容量维(图2 2 (b) ):
(1) 行动与物理相互作用(51.96%)包括精细的动作识别、身体接触检测和快速事件计数;
(2) 预测和因果关系(14.38%)评价预期行动和因果推论;
(3) 动议和发言 跟踪(13.40%)在快速运动下测试空间推理和轨迹跟踪;
(4) 实体和视觉认知(9.48%)在运动模糊的情况下评估物体和文字识别;
(5) 时间和状态动态(8.17%)涵盖时间顺序和突发状态变化;以及
(6)流出和在线检测(2.61%)针对动作边界的实时本地化.
这些维度共同评估了流出限制下的精细感想和更高层次的推理.

blocks.en:
Domain Coverage and Diversity. FastBench spans eight domains featuring rapid motion and high visual dynamics:
(1) Sports (29.08%), including motorsports, combat sports, and skateboarding;
(2) Video Games (18.63%), featuring fast-paced action and esports gameplay;
(3) Performing Arts (16.01%), including sleight-of-hand magic, card manipulation, and stage music;
(4) Animals (12.75%), covering swift wildlife movements and hunting;
(5) Lifestyle & Recreation (8.50%), encompassing acrobatic stunts, pen spinning, and active hobbies;
(6) Transportation (8.17%), involving driving, drone operations, and aviation;
(7) Science & Technology (3.59%), focusing on high-speed physics experiments; and
(8) Food & Cooking (3.27%), covering rapid culinary preparation.
This coverage supports evaluation across varied motion semantics and visual environments.

blocks.zh:
覆盖范围和多样性。 Fast Bench 跨越了8个以快速运动和高视觉动态为特征的域:
(1) 运动(29.08%),包括运动、战斗运动和滑板;
(2) 电子游戏(18.63%),以快节奏动作和港台游戏为主;
(3) 表演艺术(16.01%),包括滑稽魔术、操纵牌和舞台音乐;
(4) 动物(12.75%),包括野生动物的快速移动和狩猎;
(5) 生活方式和娱乐(8.50%),包括杂技、倒笔和主动爱好;
(6) 运输(8.17%),涉及驾驶、无人驾驶飞机操作和航空;
(7) 科技(3.59%),侧重于高速物理实验;
(8) 食品和烹饪(3.27%),包括快速烹调。
这一覆盖面支持对各种运动语义和视觉环境进行评价。
